================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATA & SERVICE ATTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

This project incorporates, processes, or interacts with data and services provided
by external providers. Users and distributors of this software must adhere to the
respective terms of service and licensing of these third parties:

1. NASA FIRMS (Fire Information for Resource Management System)
   - Data: MODIS C6.1 (Terra/Aqua), VIIRS 375m (Suomi-NPP, NOAA-20, NOAA-21)
   - Credit: Courtesy of NASA Earthdata / LANCE / EOSDIS
   - Website: https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/

2. geoBoundaries (Runfola et al., 2020)
   - Data: Administrative Boundary Polygons (gbOpen IDN ADM1)
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   - Website: https://www.geoboundaries.org/

3. OpenStreetMap
   - Data: Nominatim (Geocoding), Overpass API (Schools & Healthcare Facilities)
   - License: Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) / © OpenStreetMap contributors
   - Website: https://www.openstreetmap.org/
   - Nominatim policy: https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/nominatim/
   - Overpass API: https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Overpass_API

4. CARTO & Esri
   - Data: CARTO Dark Matter Basemap Tiles / Esri World Dark Gray
   - Credit: © CARTO, © Esri
   - CARTO: https://carto.com/
   - Esri: https://www.esri.com/

5. OpenWeatherMap
   - Data: Atmospheric Wind Vectors & Local Weather API
   - Website: https://openweathermap.org/

6. CelesTrak
   - Data: NORAD Two-Line Element (TLE) Satellite Orbit Telemetry
   - Website: https://celestrak.org/

7. NewsData.io
   - Data: Environmental & Wildfire News Headlines API
   - Website: https://newsdata.io/

8. Every.org
   - Data: Nonprofit Discovery & Relief Donation Integration API
   - Website: https://www.every.org/
